  unitName: Katsuki Bakugo (Omni)
  unitId: 810588
  unitNumber: 8435
  description: "Arrogant and aggressive, Katsuki is supremely confident in both his
    martial abilities and his explosive Quirk. Although he is known for being reckless
    and brash, Katsuki can be surprisingly kind when he wants to be. His Quirk is
    aptly named Explosion, and it is more than a match for villains and heroes alike.
    He would later on recognize\u2014even if for a little while\u2014the value of
    working together with a fellow hero in his efforts to win against All Might during
    the U.A. Final Exam."
  summonDesc: I've always admired All Might's triumphs. Nothing's ever gonna change
    that!
  fusionDesc: They'll regret making a fool of me! I'll freaking kill you! I'm taking
    the first to end all firsts!
  evoDesc: Shut up. I will win. That's what it means...to be a hero!
  element: 1
  rarity: 7
